{
  "info": {
    "name": "PawMate",
    "description": "API PawMate — Backend Spring Boot.\nDossier 'PawMate -- auth' : tous les endpoints d'authentification.\n\nWorkflow suggéré :\n1. Register → 201\n2. Verify Email (GET lien) ou Verify Code → 200\n3. Login → 200 (tokens sauvegardés automatiquement)\n4. Change Password (authentifié) → 200\n5. Refresh → 200\n6. Logout → 200",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "PawMate -- auth",
      "description": "Tous les endpoints d'authentification PawMate. Importez l'environnement 'PawMate - Local' pour utiliser les variables.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Jean\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Dupont\",\n  \"email\": \"{{REGISTER_EMAIL}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{PASSWORD}}\",\n  \"bio\": \"Passionné de chiens\",\n  \"latitude\": 48.8566,\n  \"longitude\": 2.3522,\n  \"searchRadius\": 10,\n  \"pets\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Rex\",\n      \"type\": \"DOG\",\n      \"breed\": \"Labrador\",\n      \"gender\": \"MALE\",\n      \"age\": 3,\n      \"energyLevel\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"description\": \"Très joueur\",\n      \"vaccinated\": true,\n      \"neutered\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{BASE_URL}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Crée un compte Owner (User + 1..* Pets).\n\nRate-limit par IP : 5 inscriptions max / 60 min → HTTP 429 si dépassé.\n\nPOST 201 : compte créé + email de vérification envoyé.\nPOST 400 : validation échouée (mots de passe trop simple, champs manquants).\nPOST 409 : email déjà utilisé."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Verify Email (GET lien)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/auth/verify-email?token={{VERIFY_TOKEN}}",
              "host": [
                "{{BASE_URL}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "verify-email"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{VERIFY_TOKEN}}",
                  "description": "Jeton reçu dans l'email de vérification (ou via le deep-link pawmate://verify)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Vérifie l'adresse email via le lien cliqué dans l'email.\n\nLe deep-link mobile (pawmate://verify?token=...) appelle ce même endpoint.\n\nGET 200 : email vérifié avec succès.\nGET 400 : token invalide, expiré ou déjà utilisé."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2b. Verify Code (POST)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"{{VERIFY_CODE}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/auth/verify-code",
              "host": [
                "{{BASE_URL}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "verify-code"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Vérifie l'adresse email avec le code à 6 chiffres (saisi dans l'app).\n\nPOST 200 : email vérifié.\nPOST 400 : code invalide, expiré ou déjà utilisé."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Resend Verification",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{EMAIL}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/auth/resend-verification",
              "host": [
                "{{BASE_URL}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "resend-verification"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Renvoie un nouvel email de vérification. L'ancien jeton est invalidé.\n\nPOST 200 : email renvoyé.\nPOST 404 : aucun compte avec cet email.\nPOST 400 : email déjà vérifié."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{EMAIL}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{PASSWORD}}\",\n  \"rememberMe\": false\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{BASE_URL}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Connexion. Retourne accessToken + refreshToken.\n\nBrute-force : après 5 échecs consécutifs, le compte est verrouillé 5 min → HTTP 429 même avec le bon mot de passe. Le compteur se réinitialise au redémarrage du serveur.\n\nrememberMe=false → refresh token valide 7 jours.\nrememberMe=true → refresh token valide 30 jours.\n\nPOST 200 : connexion réussie (accessToken et refreshToken sauvegardés en variables Postman automatiquement).\nPOST 401 : email ou mot de passe incorrect.\nPOST 429 : compte verrouillé (trop d'échecs).",
            "event": [
              {
                "listen": "test",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.accessToken) { pm.environment.set('accessToken', json.accessToken); }",
                  "if (json.refreshToken) { pm.environment.set('refreshToken', json.refreshToken); }"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Refresh Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{BASE_URL}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Rotation du refresh token. L'ancien est révoqué, un nouveau couple est retourné.\n\nPOST 200 : nouveaux tokens (sauvegardés automatiquement).\nPOST 401 : refresh token invalide ou expiré.",
            "event": [
              {
                "listen": "test",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.accessToken) { pm.environment.set('accessToken', json.accessToken); }",
                  "if (json.refreshToken) { pm.environment.set('refreshToken', json.refreshToken); }"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "6. Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/auth/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{BASE_URL}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Révoque le refresh token courant. L'utilisateur doit se reconnecter.\n\nPOST 200 : déconnecté.\nPOST 401 : refresh token invalide."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "7. Forgot Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{EMAIL}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/auth/forgot-password",
              "host": [
                "{{BASE_URL}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "forgot-password"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Envoie un email avec lien de réinitialisation.\n\nDeep-link : pawmate://verify/reset?token=... (pour l'app mobile).\nWeb link : http://localhost:8080/auth/reset-password?token=...\n\nPOST 200 : email envoyé (réponse générique, ne révèle pas si l'email existe).\nPOST 403 : compte non vérifié (email_verified = false)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "8. Reset Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{RESET_TOKEN}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"{{NEW_PASSWORD}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/auth/reset-password",
              "host": [
                "{{BASE_URL}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "reset-password"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Réinitialise le mot de passe avec le jeton reçu par email.\n\nLe jeton est valide 30 min, usage unique.\n\nPOST 200 : mot de passe réinitialisé.\nPOST 400 : token invalide, expiré ou déjà utilisé."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "9. Change Password (authentifié)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"currentPassword\": \"{{PASSWORD}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"{{NEW_PASSWORD}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/auth/change-password",
              "host": [
                "{{BASE_URL}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "change-password"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Change le mot de passe de l'utilisateur authentifié.\n\nNécessite le header Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>.\n\nPOST 200 : mot de passe modifié.\nPOST 401 : mot de passe actuel incorrect ou token manquant."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "BASE_URL",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "EMAIL",
      "value": "mon@email.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "PASSWORD",
      "value": "Test123!pawmate",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "NEW_PASSWORD",
      "value": "NewPass!123",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "REGISTER_EMAIL",
      "value": "newuser@gmail.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "VERIFY_TOKEN",
      "value": "PASTE_TOKEN_ICI",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "VERIFY_CODE",
      "value": "123456",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "RESET_TOKEN",
      "value": "PASTE_TOKEN_ICI",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ]
}
